#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0180 expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "A #define block carries the ADaM structure but NO #library line: $sdtm_domains (standard_domains) needs the CDISC Library, so the rule SKIPs rather than firing every populated SRCDOM against an empty domain set (the EC-14 degraded-run trap). The body is the invalid one. W4 (PLAN-list-functions phase 0, scenarios-first on the pre-port engine)."
#define standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADAE structure=BDS label="Adverse Events Analysis Dataset"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col PARAMCD type=Char label="Parameter Code"
col SRCDOM  type=Char label="Source Data"
---
S1 | 001 | AEOCC | XX
